# iTantra (always)

Offline ISRO SIH walkie-talkie. Full brief: `iTantra/.cursor/PROJECT.md` (this repo only).

**Loop:** sender STT → encrypted text (Wi-Fi Direct / BT / LAN) → receiver TTS. No server, no cloud speech.

**One current language per phone** for speak and listen. Hindi default. Ten languages including English. Detect only among installed, only on the speaker. Translate only on receive when source ≠ current. Never play source text with the wrong TTS voice.

**Modules:** `:core` (JVM logic + tests), `:android` (device), `:app` (Compose UI), `:harness` (device eval), `:models-pack` (not wired).

If `iTantra/README.md` or `docs/Features.md` disagree with this folder or the code, **follow this folder and the code**.
